{"unit_id": "DayMoon07__dsh-plugin-effort-panel#feature-1", "repo": "DayMoon07/dsh-plugin-effort-panel", "commit": "c53a09dc068fb64b1d50b2e94c6af50357390b9e", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Effort Panel 的功能「模型与推理强度面板」：在 DSH 输入框的模型入口中展示模型列表和当前模型支持的推理档位。用户选择模型或调整滑条后，插件调用模型目录的选择接口更新选择。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:423-437", "lib/client.js:695-724"]}
