{"unit_id": "DayMoon07__dsh-plugin-effort-panel#feature-3", "repo": "DayMoon07/dsh-plugin-effort-panel", "commit": "c53a09dc068fb64b1d50b2e94c6af50357390b9e", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Effort Panel 的功能「账户余额展示」：面板通过 DSH 的 remote account 服务请求账户余额，并在返回钱包数据时展示首个钱包金额；账户服务不可用或没有余额时无法显示金额。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:741-779"]}
